model, created by NVIDIA and licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International License
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/), in the int8 export for
sherpa-onnx published by the k2-fsa project
(https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx/releases/tag/asr-models, asset
